  <item>
    <title>37 | 米线、饵丝、饵块：云南人如何把大米吃出千般花样？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694fc0912db086f8973f419e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694fc0912db086f8973f419e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Dec 2025 11:26:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【云南风味勘探队】本地人带你逛吃系列</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们从云南人的冬季取暖神器“四方炉”聊起，深度探讨了云南米线的多种吃法和历史渊源。还给大家分享了云南独特的米线文化和制作工艺，从细米线到粗米线都体现了民以食为天的生活哲学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将带你深度解锁：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍜 米线千年身世之谜：它的起源，竟可能和秦始皇南征的“炊事班”有关？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍜 云南的“米线密码”：为什么换个山头，米线的粗细、口感、吃法就全变了？“饵丝”和“饵块”到底是什么暗语？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍜 工艺终极之问：米线和米粉，到底是不是一回事？云南大米如何化身万千形态？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍜 舌尖旅行指南：从昆明豆花米线的滑嫩，到阿昌族过手米线的狂野……我们为你绘制最地道的“米线风味地图”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听前重要提示：请备好纸巾，保持口腔干燥！因为接下来的每一分钟，都可能让你馋涎欲滴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">00:04:07</a>:云南人冬季取暖的本质还是要“好吃好在”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">00:06:48</a>:Goy老家的“遮放贡米”原来早就是国宴用米了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">00:10:20</a>:秦始皇时期的南下军队居然是这样吃米线的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">00:12:05</a>:米粉和米线到底有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">00:15:48</a>:米线吃法大起底：在云南，一碗有一碗的脾气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">00:20:25</a>:揭秘饵丝和饵块的制作方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">00:24:06</a>:米的变形记：饵块、黄花粑粑、泼水粑粑的吃法解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">00:30:15</a>:出名的“大救驾”其实就是一盘腾冲炒饵块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">00:32:10</a>:曲靖蒸饵丝是一种干拌的卤制吃法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">00:35:05</a>:德宏的米凉粉也是米制品的一种变形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">00:37:52</a>:云南不同地区的米线美食推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>孔雀-象乐队</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs3q94ktv11XI3CdYeU_-aIlqZZP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBBMaLxx4vwzh6Q1OgDIDyrU8ZD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr67hH3FMrdT1G3Tk_4ycZuC0lD1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTkyyNusY10J3wpbFHOMhXk9q1V.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDdW69wmN5uAoR2Fnjuc9Xh1SRB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs92DhyLkKAg9FaVnziPArYaf5qd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqwl5D0mTRndL_cNalDRvSMO7jhk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎在小宇宙、网易云、喜马拉雅、抖音或小红书搜索 “冬月冲壳子” 订阅我们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>想加入我们的“馋虫”听友群，添加VX：Goygo123，即可入群，领取我们为你整理的 【云南各地州米线终极汇总清单】 ，开启你的云南味蕾之旅！</span></p>]]></description>
