  <item>
    <title>36 | 不到喀什，怎么算到过新疆？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6926c51d0084e2631dd71be3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6926c51d0084e2631dd71be3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 09:16:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这期节目里，冬宝带着我们一路向西，走进了最靠近中国西极的城市：喀什。冰川、戈壁、沙漠——喀什用最原始的地貌，让我们重新思考生命的尺度。在这里，人既渺小，又壮阔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕐 本期时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">00:02:03</a> 新疆，一个会当你身在其中可能会开始思考人生意义的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">00:04:44</a> 喀什到底有什么不一样的魅力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">00:09:30</a> 置身自然：我们如此渺小，却也如此重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">00:14:14</a> 南疆地貌的末世感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">00:19:04</a> 空中看喀什：古城、地貌与人文的视觉盛宴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">00:23:49</a> “听不太懂，但很可爱”：喀什的普通话与本地表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1717">00:28:37</a> 从城市规划看少数民族文化的带给我们的别样感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">00:33:23</a> 重回丝路商埠：喀什古城的繁华记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2288">00:38:08</a> 大巴扎探秘：绿洲文明的生活指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">00:42:53</a> 穿越群山，见证中国基建的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">00:47:41</a> 新疆自驾指南：路线怎么走？安全要注意什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">00:52:28</a> 喀什美食浅推荐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiDIEval8S6NtHTKwcuiUMSN2a-S.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnjzPlczG5rmC-OMgz04yJz8hKCU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmzkZbDeeQcmQDAYVufeS9J5efGF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiDhAyq6lzRTgoL2r2RBfiuNFSez.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由-张震岳</span></p><span></span><p><span>（在小宇宙/网易云/喜马拉雅/抖音/小红书搜 "冬月冲壳子"，加VX：Goygo123 进群）</span></p>]]></description>
